<para id="RM000000O6K008X" category="J" type-id="304PY" name-id="672BX-00" from="200612" to="200708">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Vehicle is not guided to the set target parking position</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000O6K008X_04" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A9B00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If an alignment adjustment has been performed, disconnect the battery terminal for 2 seconds or more after the work.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the battery terminal is disconnected, perform steering sensor steering angle neutral point memorization. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001LYW00PX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Depending on the parts replaced or the work performed during inspection, registration settings for other systems may be necessary in addition to the intelligent parking assist system. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000304S000X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If registration/setting becomes necessary while proceeding with the inspection, perform the registration/setting work before proceeding to the next step.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000O6K008X_05" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000O6K008X_05_0038" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A9C00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Tire Size</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Tire Size</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Confirm that the tire pressure is correct, and inspect that the installed tires are of the specified size and are not excessively worn.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Specified Size</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the inspection result and proceed to the destination below.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000O6K008X_05_0039" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000O6K008X_05_0041" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000O6K008X_05_0039" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A9D00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Tire Dynamic Loaded Radius</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Tire Dynamic Loaded Radius</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E127424J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>On a level surface, stop the vehicle with the steering wheel in the straight-ahead position.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>As this inspection involves moving the vehicle, secure a wide area where the surroundings can be safely monitored.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Make marks on the tire circumference and the road surface with chalk, etc.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Drive the vehicle straight forward and stop when the tire has made 5 revolutions.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Mark the vehicle stop position with chalk, etc., measure the travel distance A mm and inspect that it is within the standard.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>9466 to 9871mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000O6K008X_05_0040" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000O6K008X_05_0054" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
